----------------->💻 Computer Types — Hinglish Notes 
----------------->

1. Main Computer Types
Type	Screen/Keyboard	Main Purpose
Laptop 💻	Yes	Portable, everyday computing
Desktop 🖥️	Yes	Fixed location par sustained performance
Workstation ⚙️	Yes	Professional tasks, accuracy & reliability
Server 🗄️	Usually No	Network par multiple users ko services provide karna
🧠 Easy Difference
Laptop → Portable + battery + mobility
Desktop → Fixed + better cooling + consistent performance
Workstation → Professional/complex work + precision + reliability
Server → Many users ko services provide karta hai, continuously run karta hai
📱 Other Types of Computers
Smartphone

Pocket-sized computer.

Focus: Battery life + connectivity
Examples: iPhone, Android phone

Tablet

Touchscreen-focused computer with larger display.

Examples: iPad, drawing tablet

IoT Device

Network se connected, usually single-purpose device.

Examples: Smart thermostat, smart doorbell, fitness tracker

Embedded Computer

Kisi doosre device/machine ke andar built-in computer.

Examples: Coffee machine controller, automatic door sensor

🔥 IoT vs Embedded — Most Important

Main difference = Connectivity

IoT

➡️ Network/Internet se connected
➡️ Data send karta hai ya commands receive karta hai.

Embedded

➡️ Kisi machine/device ke andar built-in
➡️ Network connection zaroori nahi
➡️ Usually specific task karta hai.

Example:

Smart doorbell → IoT
Automatic door ka internal motor controller → Embedded

Trick:

IoT = Connected
Embedded = Built-in

⚖️ Why Not One Computer For Everything?

Because every computer design is a trade-off.

Mobility costs power

Smaller/portable computer → battery limitations → sustained performance kam ho sakti hai.

Reliability costs money

Servers/critical systems mein:

Extra power supplies
Extra disks
Redundancy

use ki ja sakti hai taaki ek component fail hone par system continue kare.

Purpose matters
Phone → You directly use/touch it.
Server → You request services from it.
Embedded computer → Quietly kisi machine ke andar kaam karta hai.
🧠 One-Minute Revision

Laptop = Portable
Desktop = Fixed + sustained performance
Workstation = Professional + precision/reliability
Server = Provides services to many users
Smartphone = Pocket computer
Tablet = Touch-first computer
IoT = Network-connected device
Embedded = Built into another device

⭐ Golden Line:

“There is no best computer — only the right computer for the job.”

